      value: 21
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0414\u043E\u0431\u0440\u044B\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C, \u0432\u044B
        \u0445\u043E\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043D\u0430 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0443 \u0432 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0443?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u043E\u0442 \u0438 \u0445\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E! \u0423
        \u043D\u0430\u0441 \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u043D\u0435\u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u0438\u0435
        \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043D\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043A\u0438\u0435 \u043D\u0435\u043F\u043E\u043B\u0430\u0434\u043A\u0438,
        \u043F\u043E\u044D\u0442\u043E\u043C\u0443 \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044C
        \u043D\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].maleNPCText
      value: "\u042D\u0442\u043E \u0437\u0430\u043C\u0435\u0447\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043B\u044C\u043D\u043E,
        \u043D\u043E \u0443\u0432\u044B. \u0412 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0443 \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441
        \u0441\u043F\u0443\u0441\u043A\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F \u043E\u0447\u0435\u043D\u044C
        \u043E\u043F\u0430\u0441\u043D\u043E. \u041C\u044B \u0432\u044B\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043B\u0438
        \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043F\u043F\u0443 \u0438\u0441\u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0439,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043E\u043D\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0433\u043B\u0438
        \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043E\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F, \u043D\u043E
        \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0438\u043A\u0430\u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E
        \u0443\u0441\u043F\u0435\u0445\u0430 \u044F \u043D\u0435 \u043D\u0430\u0431\u043B\u044E\u0434\u0430\u044E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0428\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0443 \u0437\u0430\u0445\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043B\u0438
        \u043A\u0430\u043A\u0438\u0435-\u0442\u043E \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043A\u043E\u0436\u0438\u0435
        \u0443\u0440\u043E\u0434\u044B. \u042D\u0442\u0438 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0447\u0438
        \u0443\u0431\u0438\u043B\u0438 \u043C\u043E\u0438\u0445 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u043D\u0438\u043A\u043E\u0432
        \u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u043F\u0443\u0433\u0430\u043B\u0438 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043B\u044C\u043D\u044B\u0445.
        \u042F \u043F\u043E\u043D\u044F\u0442\u0438\u044F \u043D\u0435 \u0438\u043C\u0435\u044E,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0438\u043C \u0442\u0430\u043C \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u043E.
        \u041C\u044B \u0432\u044B\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043B\u0438 \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043F\u043F\u0443
        \u0438\u0441\u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0439,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043E\u043D\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0433\u043B\u0438
        \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043E\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F, \u043D\u043E
        \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043E \u043D\u0435
        \u0438\u0437\u043C\u0435\u043D\u0438\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u043E \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F
        \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0434\u043E\u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C
        \u043D\u0435\u043C\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E \u0440\u0443\u0434\u044B, \u0442\u043E
        \u0442\u044B \u043D\u0435\u0441\u0438 \u0435\u0435 \u043C\u043D\u0435. \u042F
        \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C\u0433\u0430\u043C\u0438 \u043D\u0435 \u043E\u0431\u0438\u0436\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041F\u043E\u0434\u043E\u0436\u0434\u0438, \u044F \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u044E,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E
        \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044C \u043D\u0435 \u0442\u0430\u043A\u0443\u044E
        \u0433\u0440\u044F\u0437\u043D\u0443\u044E \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0443.
        \u041D\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0448\u044C \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0447\u044C
        \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0432 \u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u043C \u0434\u0435\u043B\u0435?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0412 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0439\u043B\u0435\u0440\u0435 \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0443\u0442
        \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0435 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044B,
        \u043A\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044B\u0435 \u0442\u0435\u0440\u043F\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0432\u043E
        \u0436\u0434\u0443\u0442, \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0430
        \u0441\u043D\u043E\u0432\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442.
        \u0422\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E \u043E\u043D\u0438 \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043B\u0438
        \u043F\u043B\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442\u044C \u0437\u0430 \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043D\u0438\u0435
        \u0432 \u043C\u043E\u0435\u043C \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0439\u043B\u0435\u0440\u0435.
        \u0422\u044B \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C \u0432\u044B\u0431\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0433\u0438?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].maleNPCText
      value: "\u042F \u0437\u043D\u0430\u043B, \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0430 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F
        \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C.
        \u0428\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044B \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u043D\u044B
        \u043C\u043D\u0435 1200 \u0434\u043E\u043B\u043B\u0430\u0440\u043E\u0432."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0414\u043E\u0431\u0440\u044B\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C, \u0443
        \u0432\u0430\u0441 \u0447\u0442\u043E-\u0442\u043E \u0434\u043B\u044F \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F
        \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].maleNPCText
      value: "\u042D\u0442\u043E \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0435\u043C\u044B\u0441\u043B\u0438\u043C\u043E!
        \u0412 \u0442\u0430\u043A\u0438\u0445 \u0443\u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0438\u044F\u0445?
        \u0412\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043E\u044F\u0449\u0438\u0439 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440!
        \u041F\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043C\u043D\u0435, \u0447\u0442\u043E
        \u0432\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0448\u043B\u0438!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0417\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043C \u0442\u044B \u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0448\u044C
        \u043C\u043E\u0435 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F? \u0412\u043E\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u0439\u0441\u044F,
        \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0447\u0442\u043E-\u0442\u043E \u0434\u043E\u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u0435\u043B\u0438\u043A\u043E\u043B\u0435\u043F\u043D\u043E,
        \u0437\u0430 \u044D\u0442\u0438 \u043A\u0430\u043C\u043D\u0438 \u044F \u043E\u0442\u0432\u0430\u043B\u044E
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043F\u0440\u0438\u043B\u0438\u0447\u043D\u0443\u044E
        \u0441\u0443\u043C\u043C\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u043B\u0438\u0447\u043D\u0430\u044F \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430,
        \u0432\u043E\u0442 \u0442\u0432\u043E\u0438 \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C\u0433\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u043F\u043B\u043E\u0445\u043E, \u043D\u043E \u043C\u043E\u0433\u043B\u043E
        \u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C \u0438 \u043B\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435. \u0412\u043E\u0442,
        \u043D\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043B\u0438? \u041F\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0436\u0438
        \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0438\u0445. \u0422\u0443\u0442 \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u043D\u043E
        \u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C \u0440\u043E\u0432\u043D\u043E 1200 \u0434\u043E\u043B\u043B\u0430\u0440\u043E\u0432."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u0441\u0435 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043D\u043E. \u0414\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438,
        \u0442\u0432\u043E\u044F \u0434\u043E\u043B\u044F."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u043B\u0438\u0447\u043D\u0430\u044F \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430!
        \u042F \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u044D\u0442\u043E \u0433\u043E\u0432\u043E\u0440\u0438\u043B,
        \u043D\u043E \u043F\u043E\u0432\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044E \u0435\u0449\u0435
        \u0440\u0430\u0437. \u042F \u0437\u043D\u0430\u043B, \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0430
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E \u043F\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0436\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F.
        \u0422\u0430\u043A\u0438\u0445, \u043A\u0430\u043A \u0442\u044B, \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E
        \u043D\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0438 \u0432 \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0438 \u0434\u043D\u0438.
        \u0412\u0441\u0435 \u0442\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E \u0438 \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u044E\u0442,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043D\u0430 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0445, \u043D\u043E \u043D\u0438\u043A\u0442\u043E
        \u043D\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u043F\u043B\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u043F\u043E \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043C... \u041D\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u043C
        \u043E \u0433\u0440\u0443\u0441\u0442\u043D\u043E\u043C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u0441\u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043D\u0430\u044F \u0436\u0435\u043D\u0449\u0438\u043D\u0430.
        \u041E\u043D\u0430 \u043F\u043E\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044F\u043B\u0430 \u043C\u0443\u0436\u0430,
        \u0430 \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0435\u0435 \u0441\u044B\u043D
        \u043D\u0430\u0445\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0432 \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0441\u043C\u0435\u0440\u0442\u043D\u043E\u043C
        \u0441\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u044F\u043D\u0438\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0435 \u0437\u043D\u0430\u044E. \u042F \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u044E,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u043D\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0442
        \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0432\u044B\u0445\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0432 \u043C\u0438\u0440. \u0421\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u043E\u043D\u0430
        \u043F\u043E\u043B\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C\u044E \u043F\u043E\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0437\u0438\u043B\u0430\u0441\u044C
        \u0432 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0435\u0433\u043E \u0441\u044B\u043D\u0430."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].maleNPCText
      value: "\u0416\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442 \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u043E\u0447\u0435\u043D\u044C
        \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E. \u0412\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043B \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0439\u043B\u0435\u0440
        \u0441 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0430\u043C\u0438? \u0422\u0430\u043A
        \u0432\u043E\u0442, \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0431\u0430\u0442\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442
        \u043D\u0430 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u044F\u0433\u0430\u0445. \u042F
        \u043D\u0435 \u0432\u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0435 \u0435\u0435 \u043E\u0441\u0443\u0436\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044C,
        \u0437\u0430 \u0434\u043E\u043C \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u043F\u043B\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442,
        \u0430 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043B\u044C\u043D\u043E\u0435 \u043C\u043D\u0435
        \u043D\u0430\u043F\u043B\u0435\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].maleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043E, \u0442\u044B \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0438\u043B
        \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F \u043D\u0430
        \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0443 \u0432 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0443?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0414\u043E\u0431\u0440\u044B\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C, \u0432\u044B
        \u0445\u043E\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043D\u0430 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0443 \u0432 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0443?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u043E\u0442 \u0438 \u0445\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E! \u0423
        \u043D\u0430\u0441 \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u043D\u0435\u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u0438\u0435
        \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043D\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043A\u0438\u0435 \u043D\u0435\u043F\u043E\u043B\u0430\u0434\u043A\u0438,
        \u043F\u043E\u044D\u0442\u043E\u043C\u0443 \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044C
        \u043D\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0420\u0435\u0434\u043A\u043E \u0432\u0438\u0436\u0443, \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430
        \u0436\u0435\u043D\u0449\u0438\u043D\u0430 \u0433\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0432\u0430
        \u0437\u0430\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F \u0442\u044F\u0436\u0435\u043B\u044B\u043C
        \u0444\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043A\u0438\u043C \u0442\u0440\u0443\u0434\u043E\u043C.
        \u0421\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0432 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435
        \u043E\u043F\u0430\u0441\u043D\u043E. \u041C\u044B \u0432\u044B\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043B\u0438
        \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043F\u043F\u0443 \u0438\u0441\u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0439,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043E\u043D\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0433\u043B\u0438
        \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043E\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F, \u043D\u043E
        \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0438\u043A\u0430\u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E
        \u0443\u0441\u043F\u0435\u0445\u0430 \u044F \u043D\u0435 \u043D\u0430\u0431\u043B\u044E\u0434\u0430\u044E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0428\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0443 \u0437\u0430\u0445\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043B\u0438
        \u043A\u0430\u043A\u0438\u0435-\u0442\u043E \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043A\u043E\u0436\u0438\u0435
        \u0443\u0440\u043E\u0434\u044B. \u042D\u0442\u0438 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0447\u0438
        \u0443\u0431\u0438\u043B\u0438 \u043C\u043E\u0438\u0445 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u043D\u0438\u043A\u043E\u0432
        \u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u043F\u0443\u0433\u0430\u043B\u0438 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043B\u044C\u043D\u044B\u0445.
        \u042F \u043F\u043E\u043D\u044F\u0442\u0438\u044F \u043D\u0435 \u0438\u043C\u0435\u044E,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0438\u043C \u0442\u0430\u043C \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u043E.
        \u041C\u044B \u0432\u044B\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043B\u0438 \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043F\u043F\u0443
        \u0438\u0441\u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0439,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043E\u043D\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0433\u043B\u0438
        \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043E\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F, \u043D\u043E
        \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043E \u043D\u0435
        \u0438\u0437\u043C\u0435\u043D\u0438\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u043E \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F
        \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0434\u043E\u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C
        \u043D\u0435\u043C\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E \u0440\u0443\u0434\u044B, \u0442\u043E
        \u0442\u044B \u043D\u0435\u0441\u0438 \u0435\u0435 \u043C\u043D\u0435. \u042F
        \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C\u0433\u0430\u043C\u0438 \u043D\u0435 \u043E\u0431\u0438\u0436\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041F\u043E\u0434\u043E\u0436\u0434\u0438, \u044F \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u044E,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E
        \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044C \u043D\u0435 \u0442\u0430\u043A\u0443\u044E
        \u0433\u0440\u044F\u0437\u043D\u0443\u044E \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0443.
        \u0422\u0435\u043C \u0431\u043E\u043B\u0435\u0435, \u0447\u0442\u043E \u0442\u044B
        \u0436\u0435\u043D\u0449\u0438\u043D\u0430, \u0437\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043C
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u044D\u0442\u0438\u043C \u0442\u044F\u0436\u043A\u0438\u043C \u0442\u0440\u0443\u0434\u043E\u043C,
        \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043D\u043E?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0412 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0439\u043B\u0435\u0440\u0435 \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0443\u0442
        \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0435 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044B,
        \u043A\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044B\u0435 \u0442\u0435\u0440\u043F\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0432\u043E
        \u0436\u0434\u0443\u0442, \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0430
        \u0441\u043D\u043E\u0432\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442.
        \u0422\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E \u043E\u043D\u0438 \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043B\u0438
        \u043F\u043B\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442\u044C \u0437\u0430 \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043D\u0438\u0435
        \u0432 \u043C\u043E\u0435\u043C \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0439\u043B\u0435\u0440\u0435.
        \u0422\u044B \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C \u0432\u044B\u0431\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0433\u0438?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u042F \u0437\u043D\u0430\u043B, \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0430 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F
        \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C.
        \u0428\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044B \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u043D\u044B
        \u043C\u043D\u0435 1200 \u0434\u043E\u043B\u043B\u0430\u0440\u043E\u0432."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0414\u043E\u0431\u0440\u044B\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C, \u0443
        \u0432\u0430\u0441 \u0447\u0442\u043E-\u0442\u043E \u0434\u043B\u044F \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F
        \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u042D\u0442\u043E \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0435\u043C\u044B\u0441\u043B\u0438\u043C\u043E!
        \u0412 \u0442\u0430\u043A\u0438\u0445 \u0443\u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0438\u044F\u0445?
        \u0412\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043E\u044F\u0449\u0438\u0439 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440!
        \u041F\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043C\u043D\u0435, \u0447\u0442\u043E
        \u0432\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0448\u043B\u0438!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].engMaleNPCText
      value: Good afternoon, do you want to get a job in the mine?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0417\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043C \u0442\u044B \u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0448\u044C
        \u043C\u043E\u0435 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F? \u0412\u043E\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u0439\u0441\u044F,
        \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0447\u0442\u043E-\u0442\u043E \u0434\u043E\u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044C.
        \u0411\u043E\u0436\u0435, \u044D\u0442\u0438 \u0436\u0435\u043D\u0449\u0438\u043D\u044B..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u0435\u043B\u0438\u043A\u043E\u043B\u0435\u043F\u043D\u043E,
        \u0437\u0430 \u044D\u0442\u0438 \u043A\u0430\u043C\u043D\u0438 \u044F \u043E\u0442\u0432\u0430\u043B\u044E
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043F\u0440\u0438\u043B\u0438\u0447\u043D\u0443\u044E
        \u0441\u0443\u043C\u043C\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u043B\u0438\u0447\u043D\u0430\u044F \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430,
        \u0432\u043E\u0442 \u0442\u0432\u043E\u0438 \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C\u0433\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u043F\u043B\u043E\u0445\u043E, \u043D\u043E \u043C\u043E\u0433\u043B\u043E
        \u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C \u0438 \u043B\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435. \u0412\u043E\u0442,
        \u043D\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043B\u0438? \u041F\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0436\u0438
        \u043C\u043D\u0435 \u0438\u0445. \u0422\u0443\u0442 \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u043D\u043E
        \u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C \u0440\u043E\u0432\u043D\u043E 1200 \u0434\u043E\u043B\u043B\u0430\u0440\u043E\u0432."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0412\u0441\u0435 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043D\u043E. \u0414\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438,
        \u0442\u0432\u043E\u044F \u0434\u043E\u043B\u044F."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041E\u0442\u043B\u0438\u0447\u043D\u0430\u044F \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430!
        \u042F \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u044D\u0442\u043E \u0433\u043E\u0432\u043E\u0440\u0438\u043B,
        \u043D\u043E \u043F\u043E\u0432\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044E \u0435\u0449\u0435
        \u0440\u0430\u0437. \u042F \u0437\u043D\u0430\u043B, \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0430
        \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E \u043F\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0436\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F.
        \u0422\u0430\u043A\u0438\u0445, \u043A\u0430\u043A \u0442\u044B, \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E
        \u043D\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0438 \u0432 \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0438 \u0434\u043D\u0438.
        \u0412\u0441\u0435 \u0442\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E \u0438 \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u044E\u0442,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043D\u0430 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0445, \u043D\u043E \u043D\u0438\u043A\u0442\u043E
        \u043D\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u043F\u043B\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u043F\u043E \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043C... \u041D\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u043C
        \u043E \u0433\u0440\u0443\u0441\u0442\u043D\u043E\u043C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u0441\u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043D\u0430\u044F \u0436\u0435\u043D\u0449\u0438\u043D\u0430.
        \u041E\u043D\u0430 \u043F\u043E\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044F\u043B\u0430 \u043C\u0443\u0436\u0430,
        \u0430 \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0435\u0435 \u0441\u044B\u043D
        \u043D\u0430\u0445\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0432 \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0441\u043C\u0435\u0440\u0442\u043D\u043E\u043C
        \u0441\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u044F\u043D\u0438\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0435 \u0437\u043D\u0430\u044E. \u042F \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u044E,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u043D\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0442
        \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0432\u044B\u0445\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0432 \u043C\u0438\u0440. \u0421\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u043E\u043D\u0430
        \u043F\u043E\u043B\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C\u044E \u043F\u043E\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0437\u0438\u043B\u0430\u0441\u044C
        \u0432 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0435\u0433\u043E \u0441\u044B\u043D\u0430."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u0416\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442 \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u043E\u0447\u0435\u043D\u044C
        \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E. \u0412\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043B \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0439\u043B\u0435\u0440
        \u0441 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0430\u043C\u0438? \u0422\u0430\u043A
        \u0432\u043E\u0442, \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0431\u0430\u0442\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442
        \u043D\u0430 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u044F\u0433\u0430\u0445. \u042F
        \u043D\u0435 \u0432\u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0435 \u0435\u0435 \u043E\u0441\u0443\u0436\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044C,
        \u0437\u0430 \u0434\u043E\u043C \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u043F\u043B\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442,
        \u0430 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043B\u044C\u043D\u043E\u0435 \u043C\u043D\u0435
        \u043D\u0430\u043F\u043B\u0435\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].engMaleNPCText
      value: That's good! We have some minor technical issues right now, so we won't
        be able to work.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].femaleNPCText
      value: "\u041D\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043E, \u0442\u044B \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0438\u043B\u0430
        \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F \u043D\u0430
        \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0443 \u0432 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0443?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].engMaleNPCText
      value: This is wonderful, but alas. It is very dangerous to go down into the
        mine now. We have called in a group of researchers to help us figure it out,
        but so far I have not seen any success.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].engMaleNPCText
      value: The mine was taken over by some skinless freaks. Those bastards killed
        my employees and scared the rest away. I have no idea what they want there.
        We've called in a group of researchers to help us figure it out, but so far
        nothing has changed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].engMaleNPCText
      value: But if you manage to get some ore, then you bring it to me. I won't
        hurt you with money.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].engMaleNPCText
      value: Wait, I think you can be assigned a less dirty job. Do you want to help
        me with something?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].engMaleNPCText
      value: There are other miners living in the trailer, patiently waiting for
        the mine to start working again. Only they stopped paying to stay in my trailer.
        Can you take my money from them?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].engMaleNPCText
      value: I knew I could count on you. The miners owe me $1,200.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].engMaleNPCText
      value: Good afternoon, do you have something for me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].engMaleNPCText
      value: This is unthinkable! In these conditions? You're a real miner! Show
        me what you found!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].engMaleNPCText
      value: Why are you wasting my time? Come back when you've got something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].engMaleNPCText
      value: Great, I'll give you a decent sum for these stones.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].engMaleNPCText
      value: Good job, here's your money.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].engMaleNPCText
      value: It's not bad, but it could be better. Here, don't waste it all at once.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].engMaleNPCText
      value: Really? Show them to me. There should be exactly $1,200 here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].engMaleNPCText
      value: That's right. Here's your share.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].engMaleNPCText
      value: Good job! I've said it before, but I'll say it again. I knew I could
        count on you. People like you are hard to find these days. Everyone's out
        to make money off others, but no one wants to pay the bills... Let's not
        talk about sad things.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].engMaleNPCText
      value: An unfortunate woman. She lost her husband and now her son is in a terminal
        condition.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].engMaleNPCText
      value: I don't know. I think she doesn't want to go out into the world right
        now. She's completely immersed in her son right now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].engMaleNPCText
      value: She lives a very simple life. Have you seen the trailer with the miners?
        Well, she makes her money off the laborers. I can't judge her, she pays her
        rent, I don't care about the rest.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].engMaleNPCText
      value: So, have you decided to get a job in the mine?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Good afternoon, do you want to get a job in the mine?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].engFemaleNPCText
      value: That's good! We have some minor technical issues right now, so we won't
        be able to work.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I rarely see a woman willing to do hard physical labor. It's dangerous
        in the mine right now. We have called in a group of researchers to help us
        figure it out, but so far I have not seen any success.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].engFemaleNPCText
      value: The mine was taken over by some skinless freaks. Those bastards killed
        my employees and scared the rest away. I have no idea what they want there.
        We've called in a group of researchers to help us figure it out, but so far
        nothing has changed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].engFemaleNPCText
      value: But if you manage to get some ore, then you bring it to me. I won't
        hurt you with money.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Wait, I think you can be assigned a less dirty job. Especially since
        you're a woman, why would you do this hard work, right?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].engFemaleNPCText
      value: There are other miners living in the trailer, patiently waiting for
        the mine to start working again. Only they stopped paying to stay in my trailer.
        Can you take my money from them?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I knew I could count on you. The miners owe me $1,200.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Good afternoon, do you have something for me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].engFemaleNPCText
      value: This is unthinkable! In these conditions? You're a real miner! Show
        me what you found!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Why are you wasting my time? Come back when you've got something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Great, I'll give you a decent sum for these stones.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Good job, here's your money.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].engFemaleNPCText
      value: It's not bad, but it could be better. Here, don't waste it all at once.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Really? Show them to me. There should be exactly $1,200 here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].engFemaleNPCText
      value: That's right. Here's your share.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].engFemaleNPCText
      value: Good job! I've said it before, but I'll say it again. I knew I could
        count on you. People like you are hard to find these days. Everyone's out
        to make money off others, but no one wants to pay the bills... Let's not
        talk about sad things.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].engFemaleNPCText
      value: An unfortunate woman. She lost her husband and now her son is in a terminal
        condition.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].engFemaleNPCText
      value: I don't know. I think she doesn't want to go out into the world right
        now. She's completely immersed in her son right now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].engFemaleNPCText
      value: She lives a very simple life. Have you seen the trailer with the miners?
        Well, she makes her money off the laborers. I can't judge her, she pays her
        rent, I don't care about the rest.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].engFemaleNPCText
      value: So, have you decided to get a job at the mine?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Selamat siang, apakah Anda ingin mendapatkan pekerjaan di tambang?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Itu bagus! Kami memiliki beberapa masalah teknis kecil saat ini, jadi
        kami tidak akan dapat bekerja.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Ini luar biasa, tapi sayang. Sangat berbahaya untuk turun ke tambang
        sekarang. Kami telah memanggil sekelompok peneliti untuk membantu kami mengetahuinya,
        tetapi sejauh ini saya belum melihat keberhasilan apa pun.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Tambang itu diambil alih oleh beberapa orang aneh tanpa kulit. Bajingan-bajingan
        itu membunuh karyawanku dan menakut-nakuti yang lain. Saya tidak tahu apa
        yang mereka inginkan di sana. Kami telah memanggil sekelompok peneliti untuk
        membantu kami mengetahuinya, tetapi sejauh ini tidak ada yang berubah.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Tetapi jika Anda berhasil mendapatkan bijih, maka Anda membawanya kepada
        saya. Aku tidak akan menyakitimu dengan uang.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Tunggu, saya pikir Anda dapat diberi pekerjaan yang tidak terlalu kotor.
        Apakah Anda ingin membantu saya dengan sesuatu?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Ada penambang lain yang tinggal di trailer, yang dengan sabar menunggu
        tambang mulai bekerja kembali. Hanya mereka yang berhenti membayar akomodasi
        di trailer saya. Bisakah Anda melunasi hutang Anda?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Aku tahu aku bisa mengandalkanmu. Para penambang berhutang padaku $1.200.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Selamat siang, apakah kamu punya sesuatu untukku?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Ini sama sekali tidak terpikirkan! Dalam keadaan seperti itu? Anda adalah
        penambang sejati! Tunjukkan padaku apa yang kamu temukan!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Mengapa kamu membuang-buang waktuku? Kembalilah saat kamu mendapatkan
        sesuatu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Bagus, saya akan membayar Anda jumlah yang layak untuk batu-batu ini.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kerja bagus, ini uangmu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Lumayan, tapi bisa lebih baik. Di sini, jangan menghabiskan semuanya
        sekaligus.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Benarkah? Tunjukkan padaku. Seharusnya tepat $1.200.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Baiklah. Ini dia, bagianmu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Kerja bagus! Saya sudah mengatakannya sebelumnya, tapi saya akan mengatakannya
        lagi. Aku tahu aku bisa mengandalkanmu. Sulit menemukan orang seperti Anda
        akhir-akhir ini. Semua orang hanya berpikir untuk menguangkan orang lain,
        tetapi tidak ada yang mau membayar tagihannya... Jangan bicara tentang hal-hal
        yang menyedihkan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Wanita yang tidak bahagia. Dia kehilangan suaminya, dan sekarang putranya
        dalam keadaan hampir mati.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Entahlah. Saya pikir dia tidak ingin pergi ke dunia sekarang. Sekarang
        dia benar-benar tenggelam dalam putranya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Dia hidup dengan sangat sederhana. Pernahkah Anda melihat trailer dengan
        para penambang? Jadi, dia mendapatkan uang dari pekerja keras. Saya tidak
        punya hak untuk menghakiminya, dia membayar rumah, dan saya tidak peduli
        dengan sisanya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].indonesianMaleNPCText
      value: Jadi, sudahkah Anda memutuskan untuk mendapatkan pekerjaan di tambang?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Selamat siang, apakah Anda ingin mendapatkan pekerjaan di tambang?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Itu bagus! Kami memiliki beberapa masalah teknis kecil saat ini, jadi
        kami tidak akan dapat bekerja.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Saya jarang melihat seorang wanita bersedia melakukan pekerjaan fisik
        yang berat. Ini berbahaya di tambang sekarang. Kami telah memanggil sekelompok
        peneliti untuk membantu kami mengetahuinya, tetapi sejauh ini saya belum
        melihat keberhasilan apa pun.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Tambang itu diambil alih oleh beberapa orang aneh tanpa kulit. Bajingan-bajingan
        itu membunuh karyawanku dan menakut-nakuti yang lain. Saya tidak tahu apa
        yang mereka inginkan di sana. Kami telah memanggil sekelompok peneliti untuk
        membantu kami mengetahuinya, tetapi sejauh ini tidak ada yang berubah.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Tetapi jika Anda berhasil mendapatkan bijih, maka Anda membawanya kepada
        saya. Aku tidak akan menyakitimu dengan uang.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Tunggu, saya pikir Anda dapat diberi pekerjaan yang tidak terlalu kotor.
        Terutama karena Anda seorang wanita, mengapa Anda melakukan kerja keras ini,
        bukan?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Ada penambang lain yang tinggal di trailer, yang dengan sabar menunggu
        tambang mulai bekerja kembali. Hanya mereka yang berhenti membayar akomodasi
        di trailer saya. Bisakah Anda melunasi hutang Anda?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
