      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Wanita yang tidak bahagia. Dia kehilangan suaminya, dan sekarang putranya
        dalam keadaan hampir mati.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Entahlah. Saya pikir dia tidak ingin pergi ke dunia sekarang. Sekarang
        dia benar-benar tenggelam dalam putranya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Dia hidup dengan sangat sederhana. Pernahkah Anda melihat trailer dengan
        para penambang? Jadi, dia mendapatkan uang dari pekerja keras. Saya tidak
        punya hak untuk menghakiminya, dia membayar rumah, dan saya tidak peduli
        dengan sisanya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].indonesianFemaleNPCText
      value: Jadi, sudahkah Anda memutuskan untuk mendapatkan pekerjaan di tambang?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0414\u0430, \u044F \u0437\u0434\u0435\u0441\u044C \u0438\u043C\u0435\u043D\u043D\u043E
        \u0437\u0430 \u044D\u0442\u0438\u043C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u0442, \u044F \u043D\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0443 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044C
        \u043D\u0430 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].Text
      value: "\u0410 \u043A\u0442\u043E \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442 \u0432 \u0441\u043E\u0441\u0435\u0434\u043D\u0435\u043C
        \u0434\u043E\u043C\u0435?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[1].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0427\u0442\u043E \u0441\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u041E\u0447\u0435\u043D\u044C \u0436\u0430\u043B\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u041F\u043E\u043D\u044F\u0442\u043D\u043E..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0414\u043E\u0433\u043E\u0432\u043E\u0440\u0438\u043B\u0438\u0441\u044C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0441\u043B\u0443\u0448\u0430\u044E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u042F, \u043F\u043E\u0436\u0430\u043B\u0443\u0439, \u043F\u043E\u0439\u0434\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u041D\u0435 \u0432\u043E\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[6].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u041B\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435 \u044F \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u044E
        \u043D\u0430 \u043E\u043F\u0430\u0441\u043D\u043E\u0439 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435,
        \u0434\u043E \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0447\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[7].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u042F \u043F\u043E\u043D\u044F\u043B. \u0412\u0435\u0440\u043D\u0443\u0441\u044C,
        \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0443\u0442\u0440\u044F\u0441\u0443 \u0432\u043E\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0438\u043A."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u042F \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0435\u043B \u0440\u0443\u0434\u0443."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043D\u0443\u043B \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C\u0433\u0438
        \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043E\u0432."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[8].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].Text
      value: "\u0415\u0449\u0435 \u043D\u0435\u0442."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Item
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2647953265244385096, guid: 151dce07d4392114b8f2c3e28c7f74bf, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0434\u043E\u0431\u044B\u043B \u043A\u0440\u0443\u043F\u043D\u043E\u0435
        \u043C\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Item
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2647953265244385096, guid: 1efe695f86ae7414486ef26bb48d0555, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u0414\u0443\u043C\u0430\u044E, \u0447\u0442\u043E \u044D\u0442\u043E\u0433\u043E
        \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0434\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u043E\u0447\u043D\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].Item
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2647953265244385096, guid: 6a499fb5da70acc428b470040a39ae72, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].Text
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u043C\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E, \u043D\u043E \u0445\u043E\u0442\u044C
        \u0447\u0442\u043E-\u0442\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[9].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[3].Text
      value: "\u042F \u043E\u0448\u0438\u0431\u0441\u044F, \u0443 \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F
        \u043D\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043E \u043D\u0435\u0442."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[0].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].Skill
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[10].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0425\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[11].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0421\u043F\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[12].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0421\u043F\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[13].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0421\u043F\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0414\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[14].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u042F \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043D\u0443\u0441\u044C \u043F\u043E\u0437\u0436\u0435."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[15].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0421\u043F\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[16].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u041F\u0440\u0438\u044F\u0442\u043D\u043E \u0438\u043C\u0435\u0442\u044C
        \u0441 \u0432\u0430\u043C\u0438 \u0434\u0435\u043B\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[17].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0410 \u043F\u043E\u0447\u0435\u043C\u0443 \u0434\u0432\u0435\u0440\u044C
        \u0437\u0430\u043A\u0440\u044B\u0442\u0430?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[18].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u041D\u0430 \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442,
        \u0435\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u043E\u043D\u0430 \u043D\u0435 \u0432\u044B\u0445\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442
        \u0438\u0437 \u0434\u043E\u043C\u0430?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[19].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0412\u0441\u0435 \u044F\u0441\u043D\u043E."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].Text
      value: "\u0414\u0430, \u044F \u0437\u0434\u0435\u0441\u044C \u0438\u043C\u0435\u043D\u043D\u043E
        \u0437\u0430 \u044D\u0442\u0438\u043C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "\u041D\u0435\u0442, \u044F \u043D\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0443 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044C
        \u043D\u0430 \u0448\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[20].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[2].Text
      value: "\u0410 \u043A\u0442\u043E \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442 \u0432 \u0441\u043E\u0441\u0435\u0434\u043D\u0435\u043C
        \u0434\u043E\u043C\u0435?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
