      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[2].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Begitu, semoga sukses untukmu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: "Saya ingin membantu Anda mendapatkan RBTD \u211613."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[3].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Sampai ketemu lain kali.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Bahkan jika saya seorang wanita, saya akan mencoba.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[4].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[1].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Dengan sikap seperti itu terhadap wanita, Anda akan selalu tetap perawan.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nodes.Array.data[5].PlayerAnswer.Array.data[0].IndonesianFemaleText
      value: Coba saja, peneliti...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6430975673304087550, guid: 9bc7cc6a6b467c24ebe62fcc5db6af7c, type: 3}
